  "question": "What hotel can I find within 150 kilometers ahead of UIS Greenhouse, Springfield, IL toward the Pharmacy, Springfield, IL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.6166 39.728376)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.649748 39.794583)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'hotel'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.6166 39.728376)',4326)::geography, 150000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.6166 39.728376)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
